hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1071","Nasr bin Ali Al-Jahdhami told us, and Ziyad bin Yahya Al-Hasani told us. Ziyad told us, and Nasr said, I am Abdul Aziz bin Abdul Samad. Hisham told us, on the authority of Muhammad, on the authority of Abu Hurairah, on the authority of the Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, who said: “Indeed, God is a string and loves string.”"
